
Debug.Assert(_items.Length == OLD(_items.Length) + count);
</code>
It seems that the comment is misleading because resizing the array does not necessarily increase the count, especially if we're resizing to an array of a smaller size. But if we're absolutely sure that the count is proportional to the size, the assertion should be like this:
<code>
Debug.Assert(_items.Length >= OLD(_items.Length) + count);
</code>
